    "Form1.form.yaml": "formatVersion: 1\nproperties:\n  Caption: Duel\n  Width: 640\n  Height: 400\n  BackColor: \"#1B1F2A\"\ncontrols:\n  - name: lblFloor\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"  1P  A D 걷기 · W 점프 · S 앉기 · F 주먹 · G 발차기      2P  ← → · ↑ · ↓ · . · /  (같은 순서)      B 훈련 보기\", Left: 0, Top: 360, Width: 640, Height: 40, FontSize: 10.0, ForeColor: \"#C8CCD6\", BackColor: \"#3A3F4B\", Anchor: Left Right Bottom }\n  - name: lblName1\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: 1P, Left: 12, Top: 10, Width: 40, Height: 20, FontBold: true, ForeColor: \"#BFD6FF\" }\n  - name: lblBar1\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"\", Left: 52, Top: 12, Width: 220, Height: 16, BackColor: \"#3D7BE0\" }\n  - name: lblWins1\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"\", Left: 52, Top: 32, Width: 160, Height: 18, ForeColor: Gold }\n  - name: lblClock\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"60\", Left: 290, Top: 4, Width: 60, Height: 32, FontSize: 20.0, FontBold: true, ForeColor: White }\n  - name: lblName2\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: 2P, Left: 596, Top: 10, Width: 40, Height: 20, FontBold: true, ForeColor: \"#FFC7D1\", Anchor: Right Top }\n  - name: lblBar2\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"\", Left: 368, Top: 12, Width: 220, Height: 16, BackColor: \"#D9465F\", Anchor: Right Top }\n  - name: lblWins2\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"\", Left: 428, Top: 32, Width: 160, Height: 18, ForeColor: Gold, Anchor: Right Top }\n  - name: lblInputs1\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"\", Left: 12, Top: 56, Width: 300, Height: 20, FontSize: 10.0, ForeColor: \"#BFD6FF\", Visible: false }\n  - name: lblInputs2\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"\", Left: 328, Top: 56, Width: 300, Height: 20, FontSize: 10.0, ForeColor: \"#FFC7D1\", Visible: false, Anchor: Right Top }\n  - name: lblMessage\n    type: Label\n    properties: { Caption: \"\", Left: 120, Top: 130, Width: 400, Height: 40, FontSize: 22.0, FontBold: true, ForeColor: Gold }\n  - name: btnOne\n    type: Button\n    properties: { Caption: 1인 (컴퓨터와), Left: 170, Top: 190, Width: 140, Height: 36 }\n  - name: btnTwo\n    type: Button\n    properties: { Caption: 2인, Left: 330, Top: 190, Width: 140, Height: 36 }\n  - name: sprFighter1\n    type: Sprite\n    properties: { Frames: p1_stand.png, Left: 120, Top: 248, Width: 96, Height: 112 }\n  - name: sprFighter2\n    type: Sprite\n    properties: { Frames: p2_stand.png, FlipX: true, Left: 424, Top: 248, Width: 96, Height: 112 }\n  - name: sprHurt1\n    type: Sprite\n    properties: { Left: 148, Top: 256, Width: 40, Height: 104 }\n  - name: sprHurt2\n    type: Sprite\n    properties: { Left: 452, Top: 256, Width: 40, Height: 104 }\n  - name: sprHit1\n    type: Sprite\n    properties: { Left: 0, Top: 0, Width: 1, Height: 1, Visible: false }\n  - name: sprHit2\n    type: Sprite\n    properties: { Left: 0, Top: 0, Width: 1, Height: 1, Visible: false }\n  - name: tmrGame\n    type: Timer\n    properties: { Interval: 16 }\n",
    "Form1.gbas": "' 격투 게임의 정석(docs/DESIGN.md D139): Timer 하나가 게임 루프이고, 선수마다\n' 상태 기계가 있습니다. 선수는 키를 직접 읽지 않고 \"입력 묶음\"만 읽으므로,\n' 사람(키)과 컴퓨터(규칙)가 같은 규칙으로 싸웁니다. 공격은 표(프레임 데이터)로\n' 정하고, 맞는 곳(허트박스)과 때리는 곳(히트박스)은 그림 없는 Sprite입니다.\n' B를 누르면 훈련 보기: 상자를 색으로, 입력 묶음을 글자로 보입니다.\n\n' 선수 하나가 이번 틱에 하려는 것. 키나 컴퓨터가 채웁니다.\nStructure Inputs\n    Forward As Boolean      ' 상대 쪽으로\n    Back As Boolean         ' 상대 반대쪽으로\n    Jump As Boolean\n    Crouch As Boolean\n    Punch As Boolean\n    Kick As Boolean\n    Block As Boolean        ' 뒤로 누르고 있음\nEnd Structure\n\n' 공격 하나의 프레임 데이터. 시간은 ms, 자리는 픽셀입니다.\nStructure Attack\n    Look As String          ' 그림: punch, kick, lowpunch, lowkick\n    Startup As Integer      ' 누른 뒤 맞히기 시작할 때까지\n    Active As Integer       ' 맞힐 수 있는 동안\n    Recovery As Integer     ' 거두는 동안\n    Damage As Integer\n    Reach As Integer        ' 히트박스가 몸 앞으로 뻗는 길이\n    Top As Integer          ' 히트박스 위쪽, 선수 그림 위에서부터\n    Height As Integer\n    Low As Boolean          ' 서서 막으면 못 막고, 앉아서 막아야 함\n    High As Boolean         ' 앉아서 막으면 못 막고, 서서 막아야 함(점프 공격)\n    Air As Boolean          ' 공중에서 하고, 땅에 닿으면 끝남\nEnd Structure\n\n' 선수의 상태\nConst Idle As Integer = 0\nConst Walking As Integer = 1\nConst Crouching As Integer = 2\nConst Jumping As Integer = 3\nConst Attacking As Integer = 4\nConst Blocking As Integer = 5\nConst Hurt As Integer = 6\nConst Down As Integer = 7\n\nConst FloorTop As Double = 248      ' 바닥에 선 선수 그림의 Y\nConst WalkSpeed As Double = 170     ' 초당 픽셀\nConst JumpSpeed As Double = -560\nConst Gravity As Double = 1500      ' 초당 초당 픽셀\nConst HitStop As Integer = 80       ' 맞은 순간 모두 멈추는 ms\nConst HurtTime As Integer = 300\nConst RoundTime As Integer = 60000\nConst MaxHealth As Integer = 100\nConst BarWidth As Integer = 220\n\nDim fighters(1) As Sprite\nDim hurtboxes(1) As Sprite\nDim hitboxes(1) As Sprite\nDim prefix(1) As String\nDim state(1) As Integer\nDim stateAt(1) As Integer           ' 지금 상태가 된 때(ms)\nDim attackOf(1) As Integer          ' 하는 중인 공격, attacks의 번호\nDim landed(1) As Boolean            ' 이번 공격이 이미 맞혔음\nDim health(1) As Integer\nDim facing(1) As Integer            ' 1: 오른쪽을 봄, -1: 왼쪽을 봄\nDim wins(1) As Integer\nDim inputs(1) As Inputs\nDim attacks(5) As Attack\n\nDim computer As Boolean             ' 2P를 컴퓨터가 함\nDim training As Boolean\nDim fighting As Boolean             ' 라운드가 진행 중\nDim roundNumber As Integer\nDim roundStart As Integer\nDim nextRoundAt As Integer          ' 0이 아니면 그때 다음 라운드\nDim messageUntil As Integer\nDim stopUntil As Integer            ' 히트 스톱이 끝나는 때\nDim lastTime As Integer\nDim cpuNextAttack As Integer\nDim cpuSeen As Integer              ' 컴퓨터가 본 상대 공격의 시작 시각\nDim cpuBlocks As Boolean\nDim cpuCount As Integer\n\nSub Form_Load()\n    fighters(0) = sprFighter1\n    fighters(1) = sprFighter2\n    hurtboxes(0) = sprHurt1\n    hurtboxes(1) = sprHurt2\n    hitboxes(0) = sprHit1\n    hitboxes(1) = sprHit2\n    prefix(0) = \"p1_\"\n    prefix(1) = \"p2_\"\n    ' 프레임 데이터: 주먹은 빠르고 약하고, 발차기는 느리고 셉니다. 앉아서 하면 낮은 공격,\n    ' 점프 중에 하면 높은 공격. 점프 공격은 내려오면서 맞고, 땅에 닿을 때까지 이어집니다.\n    attacks(0) = New Attack With {.Look = \"punch\", .Startup = 60, .Active = 80, .Recovery = 160,\n                                  .Damage = 8, .Reach = 30, .Top = 26, .Height = 22, .Low = False}\n    attacks(1) = New Attack With {.Look = \"kick\", .Startup = 120, .Active = 100, .Recovery = 240,\n                                  .Damage = 12, .Reach = 34, .Top = 50, .Height = 26, .Low = False}\n    attacks(2) = New Attack With {.Look = \"lowpunch\", .Startup = 70, .Active = 80, .Recovery = 180,\n                                  .Damage = 6, .Reach = 30, .Top = 60, .Height = 22, .Low = True}\n    attacks(3) = New Attack With {.Look = \"lowkick\", .Startup = 130, .Active = 100, .Recovery = 260,\n                                  .Damage = 10, .Reach = 36, .Top = 92, .Height = 18, .Low = True}\n    attacks(4) = New Attack With {.Look = \"punch\", .Startup = 50, .Active = 1000, .Recovery = 0,\n                                  .Damage = 8, .Reach = 30, .Top = 30, .Height = 30, .High = True, .Air = True}\n    attacks(5) = New Attack With {.Look = \"kick\", .Startup = 70, .Active = 1000, .Recovery = 0,\n                                  .Damage = 11, .Reach = 36, .Top = 60, .Height = 40, .High = True, .Air = True}\n    facing(0) = 1\n    facing(1) = -1\n    lblMessage.Caption = \"1인 또는 2인을 고르세요\"\n    ShowTraining()\nEnd Sub\n\nSub btnOne_Click()\n    computer = True\n    StartMatch()\nEnd Sub\n\nSub btnTwo_Click()\n    computer = False\n    StartMatch()\nEnd Sub\n\n' 경기 시작. 버튼은 숨겨서, 경기 중에 스페이스나 Enter를 가져가지 않게 합니다.\nSub StartMatch()\n    btnOne.Visible = False\n    btnTwo.Visible = False\n    wins(0) = 0\n    wins(1) = 0\n    roundNumber = 0\n    Keyboard.ClearPressed()\n    StartRound()\n    lastTime = Milliseconds()\n    tmrGame.Start()\nEnd Sub\n\nSub StartRound()\n    Dim now As Integer = Milliseconds()\n    Dim f As Integer\n    For f = 0 To 1\n        health(f) = MaxHealth\n        landed(f) = False\n        SetState(f, Idle, now)\n        fighters(f).Y = FloorTop\n        fighters(f).SpeedX = 0\n        fighters(f).SpeedY = 0\n        hitboxes(f).Visible = False\n    Next\n    fighters(0).X = 120\n    fighters(1).X = 424\n    facing(0) = 1\n    facing(1) = -1\n    roundNumber = roundNumber + 1\n    roundStart = now\n    nextRoundAt = 0\n    stopUntil = 0\n    cpuNextAttack = now + 800\n    fighting = True\n    Say(\"라운드 \" & roundNumber, now + 1000)\n    For f = 0 To 1\n        SetLook(f)\n    Next\n    ShowBars()\nEnd Sub\n\n' 게임 루프: 입력 묶음을 채우고, 선수를 움직이고, 상자를 놓고, 맞음을 봅니다.\nSub tmrGame_Tick()\n    Dim now As Integer = Milliseconds()\n    Dim dt As Integer = now - lastTime\n    If dt > 50 Then dt = 50\n    lastTime = now\n    If Keyboard.WasPressed(Keys.B) Then\n        training = Not training\n        ShowTraining()\n    End If\n    If now < stopUntil Then Exit Sub        ' 히트 스톱: 아무것도 움직이지 않음\n    If messageUntil > 0 And now >= messageUntil Then Say(\"\", 0)\n\n    ' 1. 입력 묶음: 라운드 중에만 채웁니다.\n    Dim f As Integer\n    For f = 0 To 1\n        Dim want As Inputs = KeysOf(f)\n        If f = 1 And computer Then want = ComputerOf(1, now)\n        If Not fighting Then want = New Inputs With {.Forward = False}\n        inputs(f) = want\n    Next\n\n    ' 2. 상태 기계와 움직임, 3. 서로 마주 봄과 밀어냄, 4. 상자\n    For f = 0 To 1\n        StepFighter(f, now, dt)\n    Next\n    FaceEachOther()\n    KeepApart()\n    For f = 0 To 1\n        PlaceBoxes(f, now)\n        SetLook(f)\n    Next\n\n    ' 5. 맞음: 두 선수가 같은 틱에 서로 맞힐 수도 있습니다.\n    Dim hit0 As Boolean = Touches(0, 1)\n    Dim hit1 As Boolean = Touches(1, 0)\n    If hit0 Then Strike(0, 1, now)\n    If hit1 Then Strike(1, 0, now)\n\n    ' 6. 시계와 라운드\n    If fighting Then\n        Dim secs As Integer = (RoundTime - (now - roundStart) + 999) \\ 1000\n        If secs < 0 Then secs = 0\n        If lblClock.Caption <> CStr(secs) Then lblClock.Caption = CStr(secs)\n        If now - roundStart >= RoundTime Then TimeUp(now)\n    ElseIf nextRoundAt > 0 And now >= nextRoundAt Then\n        NextRound()\n    End If\n    If training Then ShowInputs()\nEnd Sub\n\n' 사람의 키로 채운 입력 묶음. 앞·뒤는 바라보는 방향으로 셉니다.\nFunction KeysOf(f As Integer) As Inputs\n    Dim leftKey As Integer = Keys.A\n    Dim rightKey As Integer = Keys.D\n    Dim upKey As Integer = Keys.W\n    Dim downKey As Integer = Keys.S\n    Dim punchKey As Integer = Keys.F\n    Dim kickKey As Integer = Keys.G\n    If f = 1 Then\n        leftKey = Keys.Left\n        rightKey = Keys.Right\n        upKey = Keys.Up\n        downKey = Keys.Down\n        punchKey = Keys.OemPeriod\n        kickKey = Keys.OemQuestion\n    End If\n    Dim toward As Integer = rightKey\n    Dim away As Integer = leftKey\n    If facing(f) < 0 Then\n        toward = leftKey\n        away = rightKey\n    End If\n    Dim back As Boolean = Keyboard.IsDown(away)\n    Return New Inputs With {.Forward = Keyboard.IsDown(toward), .Back = back,\n                            .Jump = Keyboard.WasPressed(upKey), .Crouch = Keyboard.IsDown(downKey),\n                            .Punch = Keyboard.WasPressed(punchKey), .Kick = Keyboard.WasPressed(kickKey),\n                            .Block = back}\nEnd Function\n\n' 컴퓨터가 채운 입력 묶음: 다가가고, 닿으면 공격하고, 상대 공격은 세 번에 두 번 막습니다.\nFunction ComputerOf(f As Integer, now As Integer) As Inputs\n    Dim other As Integer = 1 - f\n    Dim gap As Double = Abs(Centre(other) - Centre(f))\n    If state(other) = Attacking And gap < 110 Then\n        If stateAt(other) <> cpuSeen Then\n            cpuSeen = stateAt(other)\n            cpuCount = cpuCount + 1\n            cpuBlocks = cpuCount Mod 3 <> 0\n        End If\n        If cpuBlocks Then\n            Return New Inputs With {.Back = True, .Block = True, .Crouch = attacks(attackOf(other)).Low}\n        End If\n    End If\n    ' 네 번에 한 번은 조금 떨어진 곳에서 뛰어들며 점프 발차기를 합니다.\n    If gap > 75 And gap < 130 And now >= cpuNextAttack And cpuCount Mod 4 = 3 Then\n        cpuNextAttack = now + 1200\n        cpuCount = cpuCount + 1\n        Return New Inputs With {.Forward = True, .Jump = True, .Kick = True}\n    End If\n    If gap > 70 Then Return New Inputs With {.Forward = True}\n    If now >= cpuNextAttack And state(f) <> Attacking Then\n        cpuNextAttack = now + 700\n        cpuCount = cpuCount + 1\n        If cpuCount Mod 2 = 0 Then Return New Inputs With {.Kick = True}\n        Return New Inputs With {.Punch = True}\n    End If\n    Return New Inputs With {.Forward = False}\nEnd Function\n\n' 선수 하나의 상태 기계: 입력 묶음만 보고 다음 상태와 속도를 정합니다.\nSub StepFighter(f As Integer, now As Integer, dt As Integer)\n    Dim spr As Sprite = fighters(f)\n    Dim want As Inputs = inputs(f)\n    Dim since As Integer = now - stateAt(f)\n    Select Case state(f)\n        Case Idle, Walking, Crouching, Blocking\n            If want.Jump Then\n                Leap(f, want, now)\n                ' 점프와 함께 누른 주먹·발차기는 점프 공격입니다.\n                If want.Punch Or want.Kick Then StartAttack(f, want, now)\n            ElseIf want.Punch Or want.Kick Then\n                StartAttack(f, want, now)\n                Go(f, 0)\n            ElseIf want.Block And state(1 - f) = Attacking Then\n                Become(f, Blocking, now)\n                Go(f, 0)\n            ElseIf want.Crouch Then\n                Become(f, Crouching, now)\n                Go(f, 0)\n            ElseIf want.Forward Then\n                Become(f, Walking, now)\n                Go(f, facing(f) * WalkSpeed)\n            ElseIf want.Back Then\n                Become(f, Walking, now)\n                Go(f, -facing(f) * WalkSpeed * 0.8)\n            Else\n                Become(f, Idle, now)\n                Go(f, 0)\n            End If\n        Case Jumping\n            If want.Punch Or want.Kick Then StartAttack(f, want, now)\n        Case Attacking\n            Dim atk As Attack = attacks(attackOf(f))\n            ' 공격을 누르고 곧바로 점프를 누르면(50 ms 안), 점프 공격으로 바꿉니다.\n            If want.Jump And Not atk.Air And Not atk.Low And since < 50 Then\n                Dim kick As Boolean = attackOf(f) = 1\n                Leap(f, want, now)\n                attackOf(f) = 4\n                If kick Then attackOf(f) = 5\n                SetState(f, Attacking, now)\n            ElseIf Not atk.Air And since >= atk.Startup + atk.Active + atk.Recovery Then\n                If atk.Low Then\n                    SetState(f, Crouching, now)\n                Else\n                    SetState(f, Idle, now)\n                End If\n            End If\n        Case Hurt\n            Go(f, 0)\n            If since >= HurtTime Then SetState(f, Idle, now)\n        Case Down\n            Go(f, 0)\n    End Select\n    ' 공중에 있으면 떨어지고, 바닥에 닿으면 섭니다.\n    Dim flying As Boolean = spr.Y < FloorTop Or spr.SpeedY <> 0\n    If flying Then spr.SpeedY = spr.SpeedY + Gravity * dt / 1000\n    spr.Move(dt)\n    If flying And spr.Y >= FloorTop Then\n        spr.Y = FloorTop\n        spr.SpeedY = 0\n        ' 땅에 닿으면 점프도, 점프 공격도 끝납니다.\n        If state(f) = Jumping Then SetState(f, Idle, now)\n        If state(f) = Attacking And attacks(attackOf(f)).Air Then SetState(f, Idle, now)\n        Go(f, 0)\n    End If\n    Fence(f)\nEnd Sub\n\n' 뛰어오릅니다. 앞이나 뒤를 누르고 있으면 그쪽으로.\nSub Leap(f As Integer, want As Inputs, now As Integer)\n    SetState(f, Jumping, now)\n    fighters(f).SpeedY = JumpSpeed\n    Go(f, 0)\n    If want.Forward Then Go(f, facing(f) * WalkSpeed)\n    If want.Back Then Go(f, -facing(f) * WalkSpeed)\nEnd Sub\n\n' 공격을 시작합니다: 공중이면 점프 공격, 앉아 있으면 낮은 공격.\nSub StartAttack(f As Integer, want As Inputs, now As Integer)\n    Dim a As Integer = 0\n    If want.Kick Then a = 1\n    If state(f) = Jumping Then\n        a = a + 4\n    ElseIf want.Crouch Then\n        a = a + 2\n    End If\n    attackOf(f) = a\n    landed(f) = False\n    SetState(f, Attacking, now)\nEnd Sub\n\n' 걷는 속도. 바뀔 때만 정합니다.\nSub Go(f As Integer, speed As Double)\n    If fighters(f).SpeedX <> speed Then fighters(f).SpeedX = speed\nEnd Sub\n\n' 땅에 서서 다른 일을 하지 않을 때 서로 마주 봅니다.\nSub FaceEachOther()\n    Dim f As Integer\n    For f = 0 To 1\n        If state(f) <= Crouching Or state(f) = Blocking Then\n            If Centre(1 - f) > Centre(f) Then facing(f) = 1\n            If Centre(1 - f) < Centre(f) Then facing(f) = -1\n        End If\n    Next\nEnd Sub\n\n' 몸이 겹치지 않게 둘을 반씩 밀어냅니다.\nSub KeepApart()\n    Const Closest As Double = 50\n    Dim gap As Double = Centre(1) - Centre(0)\n    If Abs(gap) >= Closest Then Exit Sub\n    Dim push As Double = (Closest - Abs(gap)) / 2\n    If gap >= 0 Then\n        fighters(0).X = fighters(0).X - push\n        fighters(1).X = fighters(1).X + push\n    Else\n        fighters(0).X = fighters(0).X + push\n        fighters(1).X = fighters(1).X - push\n    End If\n    Fence(0)\n    Fence(1)\nEnd Sub\n\n' 선수 그림 전체가 경기장 안에 남게 합니다. 쓰러진 그림은 프레임을 거의 다 차지하므로,\n' 밀려나도 끝에서 잘리지 않게 그림의 양쪽 끝을 경계로 씁니다(왼쪽과 오른쪽 모두).\nSub Fence(f As Integer)\n    If fighters(f).X < 0 Then fighters(f).X = 0\n    If fighters(f).X > Me.Width - fighters(f).Width Then fighters(f).X = Me.Width - fighters(f).Width\nEnd Sub\n\n' 허트박스는 몸에, 히트박스는 공격이 맞힐 수 있는 동안만 바라보는 쪽 앞에 놓습니다.\nSub PlaceBoxes(f As Integer, now As Integer)\n    Dim spr As Sprite = fighters(f)\n    Dim c As Double = Centre(f)\n    Dim low As Boolean = state(f) = Crouching\n    If state(f) = Attacking Then low = attacks(attackOf(f)).Low\n    Dim body As Sprite = hurtboxes(f)\n    Dim seen As Boolean = state(f) <> Down\n    If body.Visible <> seen Then body.Visible = seen\n    Dim top As Integer = 6\n    Dim tall As Integer = 106\n    If low Then\n        top = 44\n        tall = 68\n    End If\n    If body.Height <> tall Then body.Height = tall\n    body.Y = spr.Y + top\n    body.X = c - 20\n\n    Dim hit As Sprite = hitboxes(f)\n    If hit.Visible Then hit.Visible = False\n    If state(f) <> Attacking Or landed(f) Then Exit Sub\n    Dim atk As Attack = attacks(attackOf(f))\n    Dim since As Integer = now - stateAt(f)\n    If since < atk.Startup Or since >= atk.Startup + atk.Active Then Exit Sub\n    hit.Width = atk.Reach\n    hit.Height = atk.Height\n    hit.Y = spr.Y + atk.Top\n    If facing(f) > 0 Then\n        hit.X = c + 16\n    Else\n        hit.X = c - 16 - atk.Reach\n    End If\n    hit.Visible = True\nEnd Sub\n\n' a의 히트박스가 d의 허트박스에 닿는지\nFunction Touches(a As Integer, d As Integer) As Boolean\n    If Not hitboxes(a).Visible Or Not fighting Then Return False\n    Return hitboxes(a).Hits(hurtboxes(d))\nEnd Function\n\n' a가 d를 맞힘: 막았으면 덜 밀리고 체력은 그대로, 아니면 체력이 줄고 휘청입니다.\nSub Strike(a As Integer, d As Integer, now As Integer)\n    Dim atk As Attack = attacks(attackOf(a))\n    landed(a) = True\n    hitboxes(a).Visible = False\n    Dim ready As Boolean = state(d) <= Crouching Or state(d) = Blocking\n    ' 낮은 공격은 앉아서, 높은 공격(점프 공격)은 서서 막아야 합니다.\n    Dim blocked As Boolean = ready And inputs(d).Block And (Not atk.Low Or inputs(d).Crouch) And _\n                             (Not atk.High Or Not inputs(d).Crouch)\n    If blocked Then\n        SetState(d, Blocking, now)\n        fighters(d).X = fighters(d).X + facing(a) * 12\n        Sound.Play(\"block.wav\")\n    Else\n        health(d) = health(d) - atk.Damage\n        If health(d) < 0 Then health(d) = 0\n        fighters(d).X = fighters(d).X + facing(a) * 28\n        Sound.Play(\"hit.wav\")\n        If health(d) = 0 Then\n            KnockOut(d, now)\n        Else\n            SetState(d, Hurt, now)\n        End If\n    End If\n    Fence(d)\n    stopUntil = now + HitStop\n    ShowBars()\nEnd Sub\n\nSub KnockOut(d As Integer, now As Integer)\n    SetState(d, Down, now)\n    SetLook(d)\n    Sound.Play(\"ko.wav\")\n    EndRound(1 - d, \"KO\", now)\nEnd Sub\n\nSub TimeUp(now As Integer)\n    If health(0) > health(1) Then\n        EndRound(0, \"시간 끝\", now)\n    ElseIf health(1) > health(0) Then\n        EndRound(1, \"시간 끝\", now)\n    Else\n        EndRound(-1, \"시간 끝\", now)\n    End If\nEnd Sub\n\n' 라운드 끝: 이긴 쪽(없으면 -1)에 1승. 2초 뒤 다음 라운드나 경기 끝.\nSub EndRound(winner As Integer, why As String, now As Integer)\n    fighting = False\n    hitboxes(0).Visible = False\n    hitboxes(1).Visible = False\n    If winner >= 0 Then\n        wins(winner) = wins(winner) + 1\n        Say(why & \"! \" & (winner + 1) & \"P가 이겼습니다\", 0)\n    Else\n        Say(why & \"! 비겼습니다\", 0)\n    End If\n    nextRoundAt = now + 2000\n    ShowBars()\nEnd Sub\n\nSub NextRound()\n    nextRoundAt = 0\n    If wins(0) >= 2 Or wins(1) >= 2 Then\n        tmrGame.Stop()\n        If wins(0) >= 2 Then\n            Say(\"1P 승리!\", 0)\n        Else\n            Say(\"2P 승리!\", 0)\n        End If\n        ' 경기가 끝났으니 버튼을 다시 보입니다.\n        btnOne.Caption = \"다시: 1인\"\n        btnTwo.Caption = \"다시: 2인\"\n        btnOne.Visible = True\n        btnTwo.Visible = True\n    Else\n        StartRound()\n    End If\nEnd Sub\n\n' 새 상태로 바꾸고 그때를 적습니다.\nSub SetState(f As Integer, s As Integer, now As Integer)\n    state(f) = s\n    stateAt(f) = now\nEnd Sub\n\n' 이미 그 상태면 그대로(걷는 그림이 처음부터 다시 시작하지 않게).\nSub Become(f As Integer, s As Integer, now As Integer)\n    If state(f) <> s Then SetState(f, s, now)\nEnd Sub\n\n' 상태에 맞는 그림. 그림은 오른쪽을 보고 있고, 왼쪽을 보면 FlipX로 뒤집습니다.\nSub SetLook(f As Integer)\n    Dim look As String = \"stand\"\n    Select Case state(f)\n        Case Walking\n            look = \"walk\"\n        Case Crouching\n            look = \"crouch\"\n        Case Jumping\n            look = \"jump\"\n        Case Attacking\n            look = attacks(attackOf(f)).Look\n        Case Blocking\n            look = \"block\"\n            If inputs(f).Crouch Then look = \"crouch\"\n        Case Hurt\n            look = \"hurt\"\n        Case Down\n            look = \"down\"\n    End Select\n    Dim frames As String = prefix(f) & look & \".png\"\n    Dim frameTime As Integer = 0\n    If look = \"walk\" Then\n        frames = prefix(f) & \"walk.png, \" & prefix(f) & \"stand.png\"\n        frameTime = 140\n    End If\n    Dim spr As Sprite = fighters(f)\n    If spr.Frames <> frames Then\n        spr.Frame = 0\n        spr.Frames = frames\n        spr.FrameTime = frameTime\n    End If\n    Dim turned As Boolean = facing(f) < 0\n    If spr.FlipX <> turned Then spr.FlipX = turned\nEnd Sub\n\nFunction Centre(f As Integer) As Double\n    Return fighters(f).X + fighters(f).Width / 2\nEnd Function\n\n' 훈련 보기: 상자에 반투명 그림을 주고 입력 묶음을 보입니다. 끄면 그림 없는 상자로.\nSub ShowTraining()\n    Dim f As Integer\n    For f = 0 To 1\n        If training Then\n            hurtboxes(f).Frames = \"hurtbox.png\"\n            hitboxes(f).Frames = \"hitbox.png\"\n        Else\n            hurtboxes(f).Frames = \"\"\n            hitboxes(f).Frames = \"\"\n        End If\n    Next\n    lblInputs1.Visible = training\n    lblInputs2.Visible = training\n    If training Then ShowInputs()\nEnd Sub\n\nSub ShowInputs()\n    lblInputs1.Caption = \"1P \" & Marks(inputs(0))\n    lblInputs2.Caption = \"2P \" & Marks(inputs(1))\nEnd Sub\n\nFunction Marks(want As Inputs) As String\n    Dim s As String = \"\"\n    If want.Forward Then s = s & \"앞 \"\n    If want.Back Then s = s & \"뒤 \"\n    If want.Jump Then s = s & \"점프 \"\n    If want.Crouch Then s = s & \"앉기 \"\n    If want.Punch Then s = s & \"주먹 \"\n    If want.Kick Then s = s & \"발차기 \"\n    If want.Block Then s = s & \"막기\"\n    Return s\nEnd Function\n\nSub ShowBars()\n    lblBar1.Width = health(0) * BarWidth \\ MaxHealth\n    lblBar2.Width = health(1) * BarWidth \\ MaxHealth\n    lblBar2.Left = 588 - lblBar2.Width\n    If lblWins1.Caption <> Stars(wins(0)) Then lblWins1.Caption = Stars(wins(0))\n    If lblWins2.Caption <> Stars(wins(1)) Then lblWins2.Caption = Stars(wins(1))\nEnd Sub\n\nFunction Stars(n As Integer) As String\n    If n = 0 Then Return \"\"\n    If n = 1 Then Return \"★\"\n    Return \"★★\"\nEnd Function\n\n' 가운데 글자를 보이고, clearAt(ms)이 되면 지웁니다. 0이면 그대로 둡니다.\nSub Say(text As String, clearAt As Integer)\n    lblMessage.Caption = text\n    messageUntil = clearAt\nEnd Sub\n",
  },
